Zero-install (recommended)Global install <pre><code>npx @meterian/cli &lt;command&gt;
</code></pre> <p>No setup required. npx fetches the latest version on first use and caches it.</p> <pre><code>npm install -g @meterian/cli
</code></pre> <p>After global install, use <code>meterian &lt;command&gt;</code> instead of <code>npx @meterian/cli &lt;command&gt;</code>.</p>
